RETIRED. This template is inert.

It was rendered by WeaveExt, which is retired: Weave.jl is unmaintained and pins
JSON 0.21 against the psy6 stack's JSON ^1.5, so it cannot be installed at all.

Its code chunks are also stale beyond Weave: `PowerGraphics._report_plot_fuel` is
commented out (see src/call_plots.jl), and `get_generation_data`, `get_load_data`
and `get_service_data` were deleted from PowerAnalytics in the psy6 port. The
replacements are `PA.compute` over a ComponentSelector.

Kept as a record of what a report contained, for whoever writes a replacement.
The original source follows, commented out.
-->

